  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4VJrCEMZ/2403c2f2a0e3c4dbe74037d11374bdb346cf060e.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"256\"></p>\n<h1>格雷机械航天</h1>\n<p><em><strong>基于 <a href=\"https://github.com/GregTechCEu/GregTech-Modern\" rel=\"nofollow\">GregTech CEu Modern</a></strong></em></p>\n<h1><a href=\"https://github.com/Argent-Matter/gcyr/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Argent-Matter/gcyr?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"许可证\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bmsXZGHQUx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://dcbadge.limes.pink/api/server/e9DrRZdqDk\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gcyr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/922713?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gcyr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/v/922713?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge 版本\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgcyr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/4VJrCEMZ?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgcyr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/4VJrCEMZ?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth 版本\"></a></h1>\n<h2>特性：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>支持太空旅行，拥有与 Advanced Rocketry 类似的火箭系统！</li>\n<li>可自定义的太空站</li>\n<li>卫星系统（包括轨道激光、采矿激光等……尚未实现！）</li>\n<li>戴森球（激活后将永久使你的太阳系陷入黑暗，即关闭昼夜循环 + 太阳和月亮消失，直到你禁用该功能）</li>\n<li>添加了另一个包含系外行星和外星生命的太阳系（尚未实现）</li>\n<li>能够通过数据包/KubeJS 轻松添加你自己的自定义星球！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>文档（制作中）：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Argent-Matter/gcyr/wiki/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Argent-Matter/gcyr/wiki/</a></p>",
